<title>USA: Windswept names Alan Schoenbart CFO.</title>
<headline>Windswept names Alan Schoenbart CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST BABYLON, N.Y. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Windswept Environmental Group Inc Monday named Alan Schoenbart, formerly of Advanced Media Inc, as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Schoenbart replaces David Behaanna, who will remain &quot;working with the CFO,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Windswept offers services such as emergency spill response and hazardous waste remediation. Its stock closed at 23/32 Friday.</p>
